        "computeAccuracy",
        "diffTyped",
        "estimateDifficulty"
      ],
      "dependencies": [],
      "taxonomyDomain": "COMMERCIAL-ENGINE",
      "gabSourceDomain": "HISTORICAL-TRUTH",
      "description": "Real-time typing challenge engine backed by the GAB Historical-Truth segment library. Calculates WPM (5-char standard), raw WPM, accuracy, consistency (inverse of inter-key latency CV), and ETA per keystroke. Returns a character-level diff array for colour-coded UI rendering. Zero framework imports."
    },
    {
      "id": "spectral-shift",
